08d54e2f1de31620fe562e1445f2fe3861e7214bdd3e29e23a","text":"补充规定 <第18426号，2004年6月11日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自2004年6月12日起生效。\n\n②（关于复议请求的过渡措施）尽管第 16 条和第 17 条的规定有所修改，但在本法令生效时正在进行复议的决定，仍适用以前的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00045","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":7794,"end":7817,"target_id":"e502426fe03201d4d6b3f796bb341056e0b505f5634d7aa9e0a2aba2fd4da5e3","source_hash":"82e6cd252d86856f3a78817030a0b28e3a2621266c3cfed257338135877eba9b","text":"补充规定 <第20249号，2007年9月6日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00046","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":7817,"end":7847,"target_id":"5a5cd6e2723d5418a1a4957894b2298347c63c8cab7119affb6250d8f7e83851","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00047","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":7847,"end":7919,"target_id":"607be798dcfc0a79dda35cd568894780866e17f6181bcbca0629e90474e299b1","source_hash":"f3f0d729cdcb5c125ecf0be2b56a1229cd699506baa772d1df4ea5215b3aab9c","text":"第 2 条（适用于书面陈述）第 7-2 条第 2 款的修正规定适用于本法令实施后首次作出驳回决定的上诉案件。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00048","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":7919,"end":7962,"target_id":"58fe1dc313ca10a950212363109b08b0f5c0b36ef3a14a4afbd9fa82ac0695c0","source_hash":"0d029278af8265dcb73fcdb5db4fa222c22c4392090c42360aebadbf9711a160","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2008年12月31日，第21214号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00049","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":7962,"end":7999,"target_id":"951231d32e54ec96f06013291062d5d15d98f6d5b1e003d0bca58c305ae3f2f6","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00050","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":7999,"end":8016,"target_id":"d46fd8694d43bdf3cb59f5664cfcb32d246a6bc5651cc727a5f68f6b04eeafee","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00051","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8016,"end":8143,"target_id":"024bbc4175fddeb4951404ddc917b71c6547947c1703cd0df8610c3e3993fbcb","source_hash":"cc55f9a2ec1a6cde5377ef5e8eb248fecc8eabd38230a895fe3a11620d4890f8","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<64> 已省略\n\n  <65> 上诉程序条例部分修订如下。\n\n  第十七条第四款后半部分中的“中央人事委员会”应改为“内政安全部”。\n\n  <66> 至 <175> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00052","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8143,"end":8185,"target_id":"b2cdd8e0bb5b4697c7496ca682dcad542ec425145fbe042a0ced9dd63952cb9b","source_hash":"875ab8aee4a83235873b291162119cdb344d6ba8382803dc8137e33dcb11d458","text":"增编（安全与公共管理部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日，第24425号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00053","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8185,"end":8310,"target_id":"170d2063a220353f3bb3a8b30797876b60a575fbcf35146eb8d6d81903f3c077","source_hash":"43029911dc2de8ee3c18d3a0db5ea54e4a90b52bf432a54ad38d3946d19ff180","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第六条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00054","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8310,"end":8327,"target_id":"7dfdce517c34318a78c64f2510f9e26edf2c04371d96c2da275d666b3014a852","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00055","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8327,"end":8448,"target_id":"ab802b9b12ba14b04227b0c1cef51f175c17a38c81cddfb49f9e92e726fa5289","source_hash":"6bcf7ee73e2bb8a368d1d20cdff10c9096056c637446edfc20e12364244cb57d","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<68>款省略\n\n  <69> 上诉程序条例部分修订如下。\n\n  第十七条第四款后半部分中的“公共行政和安全部”应改为“安全保障部”。\n\n  <70> 至 <129> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00056","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003988-280305-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8448,"end":8491,"target_id":"8fe4fe80e8e2c4d499b7cc6fe1b637e97e92afe8eeea83b6f2c013cab8c856dd","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc90